WEBVTT

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:05.765
Student promotion

00:00:05.815 --> 00:00:08.794
Open Management, then Promotion.

00:00:13.464 --> 00:00:20.157
Select the year you are promoting from, and the year you are promoting to. Then press Next.

00:00:23.442 --> 00:00:26.746
Select the class to promote and press Next.

00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:40.755
This is the highest class, so students default to Graduate. Change each action to Promote, then choose the target class for everyone.

00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:54.205
Press Promote Students. The result shows how many were promoted.

00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:03.861
Students are promoted
